        "text": "=You are evaluating content for the IULM AI Lab editorial project.\n\nEvaluate the following content.\n\nTitle:\n{{ $json.title }}\n\nContent:\n{{ $json.content }}\n\nDetermine whether the content is potentially relevant to an editorial publication covering artificial intelligence across technology, research, business, work, society, philosophy, culture, media, governance, ethics, law, education, economics, politics, institutions, science and applications.\n\nEvaluate relevance based on the actual subject of the content, not only on the presence of AI-related keywords.\n\nReturn:\n- a relevance score from 0 to 1\n- a brief reason for the decision",
